WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.433
Kyle looked around his new room.

2
00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:08.074
His sleeping bag lay on the empty floor.

3
00:00:08.075 --> 00:00:13.245
"I hope the moving truck comes soon," he thought.

4
00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:16.353
Kyle went down to the kitchen.

5
00:00:16.354 --> 00:00:21.200
He opened the refrigerator and found it was empty too.

6
00:00:21.201 --> 00:00:24.128
"Ugh," said Kyle.

7
00:00:24.129 --> 00:00:27.024
His mom walked in with a box.

8
00:00:27.025 --> 00:00:30.507
Kyle heard dishes rattling inside.

9
00:00:30.508 --> 00:00:34.561
"We'll go grocery shopping later," she said.

10
00:00:34.562 --> 00:00:37.768
"Why don’t you play outside for now?

11
00:00:37.769 --> 00:00:40.421
Maybe you'll make a friend."

12
00:00:40.422 --> 00:00:47.437
Kyle went outside and walked down the sidewalk.

13
00:00:47.438 --> 00:00:49.402
He found a park.

14
00:00:49.403 --> 00:00:53.121
But the place was empty.

15
00:00:53.122 --> 00:00:55.956
"This stinks," he thought.

16
00:00:55.957 --> 00:00:58.650
"Hi," said a voice.

17
00:00:58.651 --> 00:01:03.606
"Huh?" Kyle looked around, but he didn't see anybody.

18
00:01:03.607 --> 00:01:06.287
"Who said that?"

19
00:01:06.288 --> 00:01:09.485
"I did," said the voice.

20
00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:11.645
Kyle spun around.

21
00:01:11.646 --> 00:01:15.498
The voice was coming from a tall oak tree!

22
00:01:15.499 --> 00:01:19.723
"A talking tree?" said Kyle.

23
00:01:19.724 --> 00:01:22.769
"That's right," said the tree.

24
00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:25.055
"Want to be friends?"

25
00:01:25.056 --> 00:01:28.186
Kyle scratched his head.

26
00:01:28.187 --> 00:01:31.931
"How can we be friends?" he asked.

27
00:01:31.932 --> 00:01:37.002
"I'm a person, and you're a tree!"

28
00:01:37.003 --> 00:01:38.749
"Does it matter?

29
00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:44.614
By the way, I like cats," said the tree. "Do you?"

30
00:01:44.615 --> 00:01:47.836
"Yes," said Kyle.

31
00:01:47.837 --> 00:01:53.262
"I like playing soccer," said the tree. "Do you?"

32
00:01:53.263 --> 00:01:58.338
Kyle couldn’t imagine a tree playing soccer.

33
00:01:58.339 --> 00:02:03.032
But he answered the question because he wanted to be polite.

34
00:02:03.033 --> 00:02:07.956
"Yes, I love soccer," he said.

35
00:02:07.957 --> 00:02:11.658
"I'm in fourth grade," said the tree.

36
00:02:11.659 --> 00:02:13.858
"What grade are you in?"

37
00:02:13.859 --> 00:02:17.866
"I'm in fourth grade too!" said Kyle.

38
00:02:17.867 --> 00:02:24.066
"But how can a tree go to school?"

39
00:02:24.067 --> 00:02:27.934
"Climb up and find out," said the tree.

40
00:02:27.935 --> 00:02:32.619
Kyle grabbed a branch and climbed up.

41
00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:39.090
A girl was chuckling on a branch.

42
00:02:39.091 --> 00:02:43.466
"Hi," she said. "I'm Pearl.

43
00:02:43.467 --> 00:02:48.293
I like cats and soccer and . . . climbing trees."

44
00:02:48.294 --> 00:02:52.976
Kyle laughed.

45
00:02:52.977 --> 00:02:56.440
He had a new friend!

